        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 一个常画的题材",
          "en": "A favourite subject"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "女人梳头，或被人梳头，是德加常画的题材。这一幅，是他处理这个题材最大胆的作品之一。",
          "en": "Women combing their hair, or having it combed, often appear in Degas's work. This is one of his boldest treatments of the subject."
        }
