          "en": "about 1896 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 晚年的颜色",
          "en": "Late colour"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "晚年的德加，颜色越来越浓烈，线条越来越粗。这幅画几乎被红色填满。",
          "en": "In his last years, Degas's colours grew more intense and his lines heavier. This painting is almost filled with red."
